    "titleText": {
      "es": "Yo quería que intentáramos buscar una solución numérica aproximada, pero nooooo.",
      "en": "I wanted us to try finding an approximate numeric solution, but noooo.",
      "noteEn": "The English text is the official xkcd title text. The Spanish raster uses COMPLICADO for the official dialogue's ‘awkward’ and visibly prints POR QUÉ and SÍ with accents, although Vision transcribed QUE and SI. Vision's lone slash detection is a speech-balloon tail rather than printed text, and its line order follows page position rather than the conversation; this artifact follows the visible dialogue exactly."
    },
