      "id": "word-hicimos--fixed-hacer-un-trio",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "hicimos",
      "answerEn": "we had (as part of hacer un trío)",
      "noteEn": "Hicimos is hacer's completed-past form for ‘we.’ In hacer un trío, hacer is not the literal ‘make’ or ‘do’; the full expression means having a threesome.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Hicimos un trío con otra persona.",
        "en": "We had a threesome with another person."
      },
      "tags": [
        "word",
        "verb",
        "completed past",
        "fixed expression",
        "A2"
      ],
